**Given:**

Time (t) = 7 years

Final Amount (A) = 2 × Principal (P)

**Formula used:**

Simple Interest formula:

A = P + SI

SI = dfrac{P × R × T}{100}

**Calculation:**

2P = P + dfrac{P × R × 7}{100} 

⇒ 2P - P = dfrac{P × R × 7}{100}

⇒ P = dfrac{P × R × 7}{100}

⇒ R = dfrac{100}{7} 

⇒ R = 14(2)/(7)%

**∴ The required rate is 14(2)/(7)% per annum.**

